  "question": {
    "text": "One fourth length of a uniform rod is placed on a rough horizontal surface and rod starts rotating about the edge. At an angle <math> <mrow> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </math> between the rod and the horizontal, rod begins to slide on the edge. If coefficient of friction between rod and surface is <math> <mrow> <mi>μ</mi> </mrow> </math> , and <math> <mrow> <mtext>x tan</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mi>μ</mi> </mrow> </math> . Find x. (Take g = 10 m/s<sup>2</sup>)<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0084_22a699394f55.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 163px;\" />"
  },
